## Why This Is Asked
This question evaluates the ability to design realistic E2E checkout scenarios under network stress, locale shifts, and stock race conditions. It validates understanding of deterministic mocks, proper data isolation, and robust failure handling.

## Key Concepts
- End-to-end data seeding with deterministic mocks
- Real-time UI updates across viewports
- Locale and region switching with discount persistence
- Race conditions: stock changes during checkout
- Failure handling, rollback mechanisms, and idempotency

## Code Example
